<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18451" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφορία</span></b> , ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄφορος</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>not bearing</i>:—hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b> c. gen. objecti, <i>non-production,
				dearth,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καρπῶν -ίαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Vect.</u>
					4.9
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πίττης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>HP</u>
					9.2.4
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παίδων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					740c
				</span></i>
			 (pl.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρετῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.430
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i>dearth,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ ἀ. γίγνονται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antipho
					2.1.10
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Lycurg.
				84
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				351b14
			</span></i> (pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> in
				subj. sense, <i>barrenness, sterility,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ψυχῆς τε καὶ σωμάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					546a
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψυχῶν κρειττόνων εὐφορίαι ἢ ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Chrysipp.Stoic.
					2.337
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φρενῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Smp.</u>
					4.55
				</span></i>
			.</div>
